<!--
  Adaptive-icon foreground: a white speedometer — the app's identity is live gauges. The scale
  dots graduate small (low) to large (high) around a 240-degree arc open at the bottom, with the
  needle swept toward the high end. All geometry sits inside the central safe zone (radius < 33 of
  the 108 viewport centre) so no mask shape clips it.
-->
